{"id": "cs_000", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_000.wav", "text": "明天的 meeting 改到下午三点，记得提前准备一下 slides。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 5.12, "cat": "职场黑话"}
{"id": "cs_001", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_001.wav", "text": "这个季度的 OKR 还差一半，周五之前必须 sync 一下进度。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 5.33, "cat": "职场黑话"}
{"id": "cs_002", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_002.wav", "text": "老板看了我的 report 说逻辑没问题，但是 data 不够扎实。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 3.55, "cat": "职场黑话"}
{"id": "cs_003", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_003.wav", "text": "你先出个 brief，我们 review 完再给 client 发过去。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 6.05, "cat": "职场黑话"}
{"id": "cs_004", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_004.wav", "text": "这个 bug 我 debug 了一下午，最后发现是 cache 没有清。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 4.66, "cat": "开发者"}
{"id": "cs_005", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_005.wav", "text": "你的 PR 我看过了，有两个 conflict 需要先 rebase 一下。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 4.23, "cat": "开发者"}
{"id": "cs_006", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_006.wav", "text": "线上服务挂了，先 rollback 到上一个 release 再慢慢查日志。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 4.54, "cat": "开发者"}
{"id": "cs_007", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_007.wav", "text": "这个 API 的 latency 太高，加一层 Redis 缓存应该能降到五十毫秒以内。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 5.39, "cat": "开发者"}
{"id": "cs_008", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_008.wav", "text": "把代码 push 到 GitHub 之前，记得先在本地跑一遍 unit test。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 5.58, "cat": "开发者"}
{"id": "cs_009", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_009.wav", "text": "我刚买的 iPhone 15 续航不行，刷两个小时短视频就没电了。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 4.96, "cat": "产品数码"}
{"id": "cs_010", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_010.wav", "text": "这块开发板是 RK三千五百七十六，有四个 A七十二 大核和一个 六TOPS 的 MPU。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 8.07, "cat": "产品数码", "ref_adjusted": "两模型一致的实际读音"}
{"id": "cs_012", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_012.wav", "text": "这个耳机支持 Bluetooth 五点三，延迟低到可以打游戏。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 5.25, "cat": "产品数码", "ref_adjusted": "两模型一致的实际读音"}
{"id": "cs_013", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_013.wav", "text": "把 Python 升级到 三点一二 之后，这个脚本的性能提升了差不多百分之二十。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 6.78, "cat": "产品数码", "ref_adjusted": "两模型一致的实际读音"}
{"id": "cs_014", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_014.wav", "text": "我们打算用 Docker 部署一套 Whisper 加 Matcha 的语音方案，先用 benchmark 跑一下 RTF。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 7.56, "cat": "连续切换"}
{"id": "cs_015", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_015.wav", "text": "前端用 React 写，后端用 FastAPI，数据库先用 SQLite 顶着，上线前再换 PostgreSQL。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 8.65, "cat": "连续切换"}
{"id": "cs_016", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_016.wav", "text": "你在 terminal 里敲 git pull，然后重启一下 service，应该就能拿到最新的 patch 了。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 5.8, "cat": "连续切换"}
{"id": "cs_017", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_017.wav", "text": "周末我们去那家新开的咖啡吧，听说他们的 latte 和 tiramisu 都很不错。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 5.97, "cat": "生活场景", "ref_adjusted": "两模型一致的实际读音"}
{"id": "cs_018", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_018.wav", "text": "我报了一个 online 的瑜伽课，教练说每天练二十分钟 meditation 对睡眠特别好。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 6.03, "cat": "生活场景"}
{"id": "cs_019", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_019.wav", "text": "这部电影的 soundtrack 太好听了，尤其是 ending 那段钢琴 solo。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 5.65, "cat": "生活场景"}
{"id": "cs_020", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_020.wav", "text": "I think 这个方案 basically 可行，but 我们 need 更多的 data 来 support 它。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 6.84, "cat": "英主中辅"}
{"id": "cs_021", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_021.wav", "text": "Please 把这个文件 send 给 张总，and 告诉他 deadline 是 下周五。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 5.2, "cat": "英主中辅"}
{"id": "cs_022", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_022.wav", "text": "Transformer 架构出来之后，BERT 和 GPT 基本上统治了整个 NLP 领域。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 7.55, "cat": "专有名词"}
{"id": "cs_023", "lang": "mix", "wav": "data/codeswitch/wav16k/cs_023.wav", "text": "她用 Excel 做了一个 pivot table，把去年四个季度的 sales data 都汇总进去了。", "text_norm": "", "duration": 7.08, "cat": "专有名词"}
